 - Change comment and use variable(rtc) for error print
 - Change flag name and move flag set before ufshcd_clear_cmd
 - Add SDB mode clear UTRLCLR tag receive OCS_ABORTED requeue

V2:
 - Fix mcq_enabled build error.

